            <li><a href="/blog/tiktok-teleprompter-one-script-every-app/"><span>Reuse one script across recording apps</span>{{ icon("arrow", 14) }}</a></li>
            <li><a href="/blog/cue-cards-vs-teleprompter/"><span>Cue cards or a teleprompter?</span>{{ icon("arrow", 14) }}</a></li>
